{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8b35e2d3ec8286c9","type":"text","text":"# Black Fang Orcs\nThis orc tribe has been part of the Balshar Gorge for generations, living in the caves and tunnels of the mountains. They do not often venture into the open, where they are vulnerable to the flying Erie.\n\nThe Black Fang and Erie have maintained a blood feud for as long as anyone can remember. Black Fang warriors wear broken fangs taken from various creatures as tribal tokens.","x":720,"y":-380,"width":360,"height":350},
		{"id":"44ac8ca543fa6943","type":"text","text":"# Rock Scale Kobolds\n\nRock Scale Kobolds are a small tribe of Kobolds that have made their home in the Range of Balshar. They are and evil tribe of Kobolds, but are cowards as well.\n\nThe serve **Razor** as their leader. Ever since he came into the mountains they worship him almost like a God.","x":720,"y":0,"width":360,"height":300},
		{"id":"beef48ff2ce262cb","type":"text","text":"# Erie\n\nWhat remains of the Birdman empire. The once mighty dynasty that spanned control of the whole Balshar Mountain range. They have been in decline for quite some time, with the loss of their young going out to see the world and also their birthrate ever decreasing. Now they are little more than a village with the surrounding area, but they have still been able keep their superiority","x":720,"y":320,"width":360,"height":280},
		{"id":"76a291956496b6e9","type":"text","text":"# Razor","x":720,"y":640,"width":360,"height":280},
		{"id":"282130a8cfbc085d","type":"text","text":"# What is happening?\nA Dragon has taken up residence in the [[Western Balshar Mountain Range]] It has quickly Won the [[Kobolds]] over to it's side and has quitely made and alliance with the [[Orcs]] of the Balshar Region. The [[Erie]] has been able to maintain it's superiority due to it's ability to fly. [[Orcs]] and [[Kobolds]] in general don't have the ability to do this. The Erie have been protectors of the mountains and secretly guardians of the resting place of the Dragon flights, the location of a ancient battle where the [[Erie]] and the Dragons fought for superiority of both the [[Western Balshar Mountain Range]] and [[Eastern Balsher Mountain Range]]. The Dragons were defeated and in the subsiquent age, the power of the Erie has Wained. They are now nothing but a shadow of the Dynasty that they once were, but the memory of the Dragon's runs deep. [[Razor]] a Dragon of the [[Meegalalor Hills]] has migrated up the the West Range of Balshar to see if the mountains could once again be his race's home.","x":-140,"y":115,"width":585,"height":410},
		{"id":"0f377e4e8c7e5896","x":-140,"y":580,"width":585,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"# Encounters:\n- [ ] Dragon Shadow\n- [ ] Owlbear\n- [ ] Orc Patrol\n- [ ] Kobold Excavation Crew\n- [ ] 3 Lions\n- [ ] 6 Wargs\n- [ ] 1 griffon"}
	],
